{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774051975,"nonce":"is8q5gywqJXvYYlNR7Sis4yco6g=","title":"Concurrent preset editing: optimistic locking","message":"If the user has the Presets tab open in multiple browser tabs (or Tauri window plus browser), concurrent edits to the same preset tree could corrupt node ordering. Implement optimistic locking via updated_at check at write time — reject writes where the stored updated_at differs from the value the client read. Return 409 Conflict so the UI can prompt to reload.\n\nRelated to the Presets tab feature (umbrella c58acc8).","files":null}]}